# m6_fork: forks across hold-B rewinds. m2_play's sweep carried on to 4399 with three hold-Bs:
# two that each go back past a fork collection and one with ghosts and their bolts in flight.
# Forks replay the ship's own trail 24 ticks per ghost behind and fire a level-1 volley of the
# current weapon (M7) where the ship fired then; debug_history_check (0 = the world rebuilt
# from keyframe + input log is identical) is the point of the script.
# In god mode (debug_god at 31), since on this sweep a normal game dies in stage 1 and a probe
# game loses each fork to the next hit, so it never holds two.
# Re-pinned for the catch-up clock (waves come sooner on a thin field, so the sweep powers up
# and meets its crates earlier): the first hold moved from 2084..2093 to 2070..2079 and the
# third from 4050..4064 to 2595..2609, to straddle the fork grabs again; the 3320 hold stays.
# Re-pinned for the mode paces (NORMAL: the table clock hurries, 3 ticks a tick, only on an
# empty field): the waves come later and the forks with them (at 2070 and 2595 the holds
# crossed no fork grab), so the first hold moved from 2070..2079 to 1795..1804 and the third
# from 2595..2609 to 2608..2622, 12 and 9 updates after a fork grab as before; the 3320 hold
# stays, now with three ghosts in flight.
# - 1783 (game tick 1753): fork 1. B 1795..1804 (10 frames = 20 ticks, 1764 -> 1744): 1799
#   is back at tick 1754, forks 1; 1800 (tick 1752) is before the grab: forks 0. 1805 is the
#   release (PLAYING, no tick), 1806 the first live tick; the sweep then runs 30 updates
#   ahead of the world and grabs the same crate again at 1879 (tick 1818).
# - 2599 (tick 2538): fork 2, two ghosts. B 2608..2622 (15 frames = 30 ticks, 2546 -> 2516):
#   2611 is back at tick 2538, forks 2; 2612 (tick 2536) is before the grab: forks 1. 2623 the
#   release, 2624 the first live tick. The shifted sweep grabs the same crate again at 2716
#   (tick 2609).
# - Weapon (kind * 10 + level): F5 at 3096; 3262: fork 3, three ghosts. The 3320..3334 hold
#   runs with the three ghosts and their bolts in flight (more than 30): 3330 is a held frame
#   (state 5), 3335 the release (no tick), 3336 the first live tick. A5 (15) at 3671, the
#   Heisenbug at 3676, still alive at the end (it died at 4053 under the catch-up clock).
--frames 4400 --call-at "31 debug_god" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_weapon,debug_forks,debug_shield,debug_bolts,debug_rewinds --at "1782 debug_forks == 0" --at "1783 debug_forks == 1" --at "1794 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1795 debug_state == 5" --at "1799 debug_forks == 1" --at "1799 debug_game_tick == 1754" --at "1800 debug_forks == 0" --at "1800 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1804 debug_state == 5" --at "1804 debug_game_tick == 1744" --at "1804 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1805 debug_state == 1" --at "1805 debug_forks == 0" --at "1805 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1806 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1878 debug_forks == 0" --at "1879 debug_forks == 1" --at "2598 debug_forks == 1" --at "2599 debug_forks == 2" --at "2607 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2608 debug_state == 5" --at "2611 debug_forks == 2" --at "2612 debug_forks == 1" --at "2612 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2622 debug_state == 5" --at "2622 debug_game_tick == 2516" --at "2622 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2623 debug_state == 1" --at "2623 debug_forks == 1" --at "2623 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2624 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2715 debug_forks == 1" --at "2716 debug_forks == 2" --at "2700 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3096 debug_weapon == 5" --at "3261 debug_forks == 2" --at "3262 debug_forks == 3" --at "3300 debug_bolts > 30" --at "3300 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3330 debug_state == 5" --at "3330 debug_forks == 3" --at "3330 debug_bolts > 30" --at "3330 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3335 debug_state == 1" --at "3335 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3336 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3670 debug_weapon == 5" --at "3671 debug_weapon == 15" --at "3676 debug_boss_id == 0" --at "4300 debug_bolts > 10" --at "4300 debug_history_check == 0" --at "4399 debug_history_check == 0" --expect "debug_state == 1" --expect "debug_forks == 3" --expect "debug_rewinds == 3"
